---
import Layout from '../layouts/Cinematic.astro';
---

<Layout title="Colophon" description="How this site is made, and what it does not collect.">
  <section class="plain" aria-labelledby="col-h">
    <p class="label">Colophon</p>
    <h1 id="col-h">Nothing <em>collected.</em></h1>
    <p id="privacy">
      This site sets no cookies, runs no analytics and loads nothing from other companies. Every file, including the fonts
      and the 3D library behind the particles, is served from this site. A strict content security policy makes sure it
      stays that way.
    </p>
    <p>If you'd like to check, open your browser's developer tools and look at the network and storage tabs.</p>
    <p>
      Set in Inter Tight and Instrument Serif. The particles are drawn with three.js. Designed and built by me. <a href="/">Back to the start</a>
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
